{"availability":"available","full":"mdjwel/buttonz","name":"buttonz","description":"Elementor advanced button addons WordPress plugin","category":"Other","language":"PHP","stars":2,"forks":1,"created":"2021-02-23T07:22:09Z","updated":"2021-02-24T12:05:35Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["elementor","elementor-addon","wordpress"],"demo":"https://wordpress.creativegigs.net/docly/buttonz-buttons/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T21:05:43.659Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T21:05:43.659Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T21:05:43.659Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T21:05:43.659Z","stars":2,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["=== ButtonZ - Elementor Addon === Contributors: mdjwel Tags: elementor, addons, elementor widget, button, button hover effects Requires PHP: 5.6 Requires at least: 4.7 Tested up to: 5.6 Stable tag: 1.3.1 License: GPLv3 or later License URI:","With ButtonZ Elementor addon you can create any type of great-looking CSS3 WordPress buttons in very short time. The button editor with Elementor live preview makes it a snap to generate awesome responsive buttons in very little time.","In a website, we need to create many types of buttons. The Elementor default button widget has very limited options. You can't even apply a hover shadow effect with that widget as well as you can not imagine creating complex buttons. ButtonZ plugin fulfills all of these limitations and gives you super flexibility for creating incredible buttons. It has many extra options available than the Elementor’s default button widget."],"features":["Unlimited Normal Button, Line Button, Border Button, 3D button","4 Type Button with unlimited possibilities","Button typography controls","Button Shadow Hover Color","Button Background-color"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mdjwel/buttonz/blob/main/readme.md","fingerprint":"add46087ba6bf69b99798e7f66a5c2df5e166e52383b65a87f4d5744ec6b5762","ext